### Uji API Praktikum ORM (ekstensi VS Code "REST Client": klik "Send Request")
### Jalankan dulu: php artisan migrate:fresh --seed && php artisan serve

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. Daftar jenis surat -> 200
GET {{base}}/jenis-surat
Accept: application/json

### 2. Daftar mahasiswa + jumlah surat -> 200
GET {{base}}/mahasiswa?q=andi
Accept: application/json

### 3. Tambah mahasiswa -> 201 (id = 23)
POST {{base}}/mahasiswa
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim": "2301050", "nama": "Rina Wulandari", "prodi": "Sistem Informasi", "angkatan": 2023}

### 4. Validasi gagal -> 422
POST {{base}}/mahasiswa
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim": "2201001", "nama": "", "angkatan": 1990}

### 5. Ubah sebagian data -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/mahasiswa/23
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"prodi": "Teknik Informatika"}

### 6. Detail mahasiswa + surat + jenis surat (eager loading) -> 200
GET {{base}}/mahasiswa/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Ajukan surat (transaksi: surat + riwayat) -> 201
POST {{base}}/surat
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"mahasiswa_id": 23, "jenis_surat_id": 3, "keperluan": "Penelitian skripsi di Diskominfo."}

### 8. Ajukan surat, mahasiswa tidak ada -> 422
POST {{base}}/surat
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"mahasiswa_id": 999, "jenis_surat_id": 3, "keperluan": "x"}

### 9. Ubah status -> 200 (2 riwayat)
PATCH {{base}}/surat/23/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "diproses", "catatan": "Verifikasi BAAK"}

### 10. Aturan bisnis menolak (Selesai -> Diproses) -> 422
PATCH {{base}}/surat/1/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "diproses"}

### 11. Filter surat per status + paginasi -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat?status=diproses&per_page=2
Accept: application/json

### 12. Hapus mahasiswa (surat ikut terhapus / cascade) -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/mahasiswa/23
Accept: application/json

### 13. Surat milik mahasiswa yang dihapus -> 404
GET {{base}}/surat/23
Accept: application/json

### 14. Mahasiswa tidak ada -> 404
GET {{base}}/mahasiswa/999
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 1a. Hapus jenis surat yang masih dipakai -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/jenis-surat/1
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 1b. Tambah jenis surat -> 201
POST {{base}}/jenis-surat
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"kode": "LMB", "nama": "Surat Keterangan Lembur"}

### Latihan 1c. Ubah jenis surat -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/jenis-surat/5
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama": "Surat Keterangan Lembur Akademik"}

### Latihan 1d. Hapus jenis surat yang tidak dipakai -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/jenis-surat/5
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 2. Statistik surat -> 200
GET {{base}}/statistik
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 3. Detail surat memuat dosen penyetuju -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat/1
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 4a. Soft delete surat -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/surat/1
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 4b. Surat terhapus tidak tampil -> 404
GET {{base}}/surat/1
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 4c. Daftar surat terhapus -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat/terhapus
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 4d. Pulihkan surat -> 200
POST {{base}}/surat/1/restore
Accept: application/json

### Latihan 4e. Surat kembali tampil -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat/1
Accept: application/json
